<title>GERMANY: Altana suspends Pantoprazol successor.</title>
<headline>Altana suspends Pantoprazol successor.</headline>
<dateline>BAD HOMBURG, Germany 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceutical group Altana AG said on Monday that it had suspended the clinical development of the successor to its Pantoprazol drug.</p>
<p>&quot;The suspension of the development of the Pumazol successor to Pantaprazol will have no effect on earnings,&quot; Paul Reuter, head of subsidiaries at Altana, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
